ed-solution "Using the result \n\n$$\n{∇}_{w}({w}^{T}w)=2w,\n$$\n\nwe have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∇}_{w}f & ={∇}_{w}(‖w{‖}^{2}+5) \\\\  & ={∇}_{w}(‖w{‖}^{2})+{∇}_{w}(5) \\\\  & ={∇}_{w}({w}^{T}w)+{∇}_{w}(5) \\\\  & =2w+0 \\\\  & =2w.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-686f6ab1-3c92-5b4d-8856-0f89e6d06790"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-686f6ab1-3c92-5b4d-8856-0f89e6d06790" :answer-field/id #uuid "686f6ab1-3c92-5b4d-8856-0f89e6d06790" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-083c30b1-6494-5f7f-a514-ca4c654a14b8" :answer-field/choices ["answer-083c30b1-6494-5f7f-a514-ca4c654a14b8" "answer-47f56299-6e42-5254-9516-56c603e5c09b" "answer-a8093673-d050-5c58-a366-237171d4a6fb" "answer-c28f8240-f44e-5faa-96ab-53a10a8bcfbf" "answer-935bd9b2-fb76-558f-97bd-419defc9c8dc"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-083c30b1-6494-5f7f-a514-ca4c654a14b8" :answer/id #uuid "083c30b1-6494-5f7f-a514-ca4c654a14b8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2w" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-47f56299-6e42-5254-9516-56c603e5c09b" :answer/id #uuid "47f56299-6e42-5254-9516-56c603e5c09b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2‖w‖" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a8093673-d050-5c58-a366-237171d4a6fb" :answer/id #uuid "a8093673-d050-5c58-a366-237171d4a6fb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "w" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c28f8240-f44e-5faa-96ab-53a10a8bcfbf" :answer/id #uuid "c28f8240-f44e-5faa-96ab-53a10a8bcfbf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "‖w‖" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-935bd9b2-fb76-558f-97bd-419defc9c8dc" :answer/id #uuid "935bd9b2-fb76-558f-97bd-419defc9c8dc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "‖w‖+5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-f23dae50-683b-52ff-a0e9-aa781506dfbd" :question/id #uuid "f23dae50-683b-52ff-a0e9-aa781506dfbd" :question/math-academy-id "q-275974" :question/problem "Given the function \n\n$$\nf(w)=-3‖w{‖}_{1}+4{w}^{T}w\n$$\n\nthat maps a vector to a scalar, find ${∇}_{w}f.$ You may assume that $w$ has all nonzero components." :question/worked-solution "Using the results\n\n$$\n{∇}_{w}(‖w{‖}_{1})=\\text{sign}(w),\\,{∇}_{w}({w}^{T}w)=2w,\n$$\n\n we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∇}_{w}f & ={∇}_{w}(-3‖w{‖}_{1}+4{w}^{T}w) \\\\  & ={∇}_{w}(-3‖w{‖}_{1})+{∇}_{w}(4{w}^{T}w) \\\\  & =-3\\cdot {∇}_{w}(‖w{‖}_{1})+4\\cdot {∇}_{w}({w}^{T}w) \\\\  & =-3\\cdot \\text{sign}(w)+4\\cdot 2w \\\\  & =-3\\,\\text{sign}(w)+8w.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-448996fe-7d15-51b5-8f3e-ca1be20c428a"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-448996fe-7d15-51b5-8f3e-ca1be20c428a" :answer-field/id #uuid "448996fe-7d15-51b5-8f3e-ca1be20c428a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-8ce8efbb-4e33-5a7e-bf18-9c80b8c4e113" :answer-field/choices ["answer-66ed4cea-665a-5375-a9b4-cee68cc6509c" "answer-1b454009-16d3-573a-8860-b5f66c0e8574" "answer-8ce8efbb-4e33-5a7e-bf18-9c80b8c4e113" "answer-3de5aed6-adb6-5f7e-a8b9-639422fec946" "answer-91ca6108-da53-5c40-95ca-d19493e3631c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-66ed4cea-665a-5375-a9b4-cee68cc6509c" :answer/id #uuid "66ed4cea-665a-5375-a9b4-cee68cc6509c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3\\,\\text{sign}(w)+2{w}^{T}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1b454009-16d3-573a-8860-b5f66c0e8574" :answer/id #uuid "1b454009-16d3-573a-8860-b5f66c0e8574" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3\\,\\text{sign}(w)+4w" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8ce8efbb-4e33-5a7e-bf18-9c80b8c4e113" :answer/id #uuid "8ce8efbb-4e33-5a7e-bf18-9c80b8c4e113" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3\\,\\text{sign}(w)+8w" :db/ensure [